1
00:00:00,008 --> 00:00:01,470
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,472 --> 00:00:03,004
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,583 --> 00:00:05,939
(Episode 62)

4
00:00:09,116 --> 00:00:10,179
Where am I?

5
00:00:11,916 --> 00:00:13,019
Hello?

6
00:00:17,585 --> 00:00:18,585
Na Ji Ni?

7
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,363
Yeah, it's me.

8
00:00:20,827 --> 00:00:21,849
You're awake.

9
00:00:22,115 --> 00:00:23,429
Why are you here?

10
00:00:24,291 --> 00:00:25,602
How did I get here?

11
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,523
Nurse!

12
00:00:27,547 --> 00:00:29,116
- Nurse!
- What?

13
00:00:29,445 --> 00:00:30,633
Are you afraid to die?

14
00:00:30,693 --> 00:00:32,573
You're not afraid to kill others,
but you're afraid to die?

15
00:00:32,691 --> 00:00:35,400
When did I ever try to kill anyone?

16
00:00:36,673 --> 00:00:39,703
I was just trying to scare you.
I was so angry.

17
00:00:39,728 --> 00:00:42,018
Attempted murder is still murder.

18
00:00:42,484 --> 00:00:44,090
This is the second time.

19
00:00:44,598 --> 00:00:47,594
Back in eighth grade, in the storage room,
what did you do to me?

20
00:00:47,891 --> 00:00:51,815
If my dad hadn't come looking for me,
you would've killed me that day.

21
00:00:52,638 --> 00:00:54,612
I remember...

22
00:00:55,784 --> 00:00:58,016
- all that terror, all that fear.
- I'm sorry.

23
00:00:59,353 --> 00:01:01,621
But still,

24
00:01:02,138 --> 00:01:05,087
dragging me up here is a bit much,
don't you think?

25
00:01:10,552 --> 00:01:13,816
Hey! What are you doing? Stop!

26
00:01:26,418 --> 00:01:27,864
Hey!

27
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:33,642
You're still claiming you're too sick
to be questioned after this?

28
00:01:34,545 --> 00:01:36,163
You're still under treatment?

29
00:01:36,187 --> 00:01:37,282
You?

30
00:01:39,641 --> 00:01:40,641
Hey!

31
00:01:46,538 --> 00:01:49,262
Just die already!

32
00:01:50,052 --> 00:01:52,110
I should've killed you
in that school storage room.

33
00:02:09,492 --> 00:02:10,759
How have you been?

34
00:02:11,278 --> 00:02:12,782
There's an opening
for an experienced hire.

35
00:02:13,175 --> 00:02:14,356
You should apply.

36
00:02:16,831 --> 00:02:18,847
Seung Hyun!

37
00:02:19,004 --> 00:02:21,260
- What?
- Ji Ni's gone.

38
00:02:21,285 --> 00:02:22,473
She's not answering her phone,

39
00:02:22,497 --> 00:02:25,020
and I think she went to see Ji Hu again.

40
00:02:25,045 --> 00:02:26,687
Please come to the hospital with me.

41
00:02:26,712 --> 00:02:28,411
I can't bring her back alone.

42
00:02:30,144 --> 00:02:31,809
Please help me.

43
00:02:31,834 --> 00:02:34,576
If she goes there alone,
who's going to protect her?

44
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:36,599
Let's go.

45
00:02:37,753 --> 00:02:38,919
Seung Woo!

46
00:02:59,092 --> 00:03:00,459
Seung Hyun, wait.

47
00:03:01,018 --> 00:03:03,949
Ask Se Ri to look for her,
then come up to the roof.

48
00:03:04,035 --> 00:03:05,068
I'll be there too.

49
00:03:07,179 --> 00:03:08,598
Something feels off.

50
00:03:11,012 --> 00:03:14,135
You talk big for someone
who doesn't even have the guts to kill.

51
00:03:15,158 --> 00:03:17,010
You think you're a match for me?

52
00:03:25,771 --> 00:03:27,217
I love Ji Hu.

53
00:03:27,416 --> 00:03:29,003
You helped me realize that.

54
00:03:29,144 --> 00:03:31,040
When he wakes up, I'll really love him.

55
00:03:31,065 --> 00:03:33,378
- I'll never let you have him.
- What?

56
00:03:34,418 --> 00:03:36,003
You little cockroach!

57
00:03:39,873 --> 00:03:40,873
Let go!

58
00:03:46,292 --> 00:03:47,385
What are you doing?

59
00:03:48,002 --> 00:03:49,179
Do Do Hee!

60
00:03:54,958 --> 00:03:55,958
Are you okay?

61
00:03:57,455 --> 00:03:58,892
What brings you here?

62
00:04:00,015 --> 00:04:01,015
What?

63
00:04:01,799 --> 00:04:02,904
Director?

64
00:04:04,032 --> 00:04:05,447
I'm asking what you two are doing!

65
00:04:05,472 --> 00:04:06,986
Just go to prison.

66
00:04:07,092 --> 00:04:08,307
Stay there for the rest of your life.

67
00:04:08,332 --> 00:04:10,100
She dragged me all the way up here!

68
00:04:10,359 --> 00:04:12,418
Get your facts straight, you idiot!

69
00:04:13,941 --> 00:04:15,007
Idiot?

70
00:04:15,817 --> 00:04:17,168
You let her talk to you like that?

71
00:04:18,985 --> 00:04:20,922
- Who are you?
- Never mind that.

72
00:04:21,569 --> 00:04:22,669
Call the cops now.

73
00:04:24,071 --> 00:04:25,736
I said don't!

74
00:04:26,335 --> 00:04:27,868
You should report her!

75
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,450
She dragged a patient all the way up here!

76
00:04:29,475 --> 00:04:30,689
Are you even a patient?

77
00:04:31,165 --> 00:04:32,165
Director.

78
00:04:32,708 --> 00:04:34,811
Do you like her too?

79
00:04:35,028 --> 00:04:36,028
She's...

80
00:04:38,352 --> 00:04:39,530
my little sister.

81
00:04:44,344 --> 00:04:45,413
Your little sister?

82
00:04:45,644 --> 00:04:46,753
Your real sister?

83
00:04:52,265 --> 00:04:53,808
- What the...
- At someone else's funeral, no less!

84
00:04:55,432 --> 00:04:57,169
Please refrain from making a scene.

85
00:05:13,638 --> 00:05:14,677
No way!

86
00:05:15,338 --> 00:05:17,997
Is Cha Min Ki the dad of all three of you?

87
00:05:18,965 --> 00:05:20,200
So that means...

88
00:05:20,437 --> 00:05:22,292
you're half-siblings with Na Ji Ni?

89
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:25,658
And you two are the ones
whose families his affair tore apart?

90
00:05:28,230 --> 00:05:30,521
Hey! That's hilarious!

91
00:05:30,523 --> 00:05:32,625
What a dysfunctional family!

92
00:05:35,472 --> 00:05:37,335
Let's go. Can you walk?

93
00:05:37,918 --> 00:05:39,979
- Yes.
- This is unbelievable. Seriously!

94
00:05:43,625 --> 00:05:44,632
Hey, you!

95
00:05:44,656 --> 00:05:45,921
Hey, Do Do Hee!

96
00:05:47,662 --> 00:05:48,925
Wasn't it the right leg?

97
00:05:48,949 --> 00:05:50,289
It was the left one.

98
00:05:51,918 --> 00:05:53,820
- You knew and still kicked him?
- So what?

99
00:05:54,622 --> 00:05:56,007
What?

100
00:06:01,131 --> 00:06:02,545
- Let's go.
- Are you laughing?

101
00:06:02,738 --> 00:06:04,540
Hey! Are you laughing at me?

102
00:06:05,858 --> 00:06:07,979
I got it all on camera.
You were fine and avoided questioning.

103
00:06:08,013 --> 00:06:11,034
I don't care how powerful your dad is.
I'll make sure you get questioned.

104
00:06:16,965 --> 00:06:17,965
Hey.

105
00:06:18,245 --> 00:06:19,258
Hey!

106
00:06:19,615 --> 00:06:20,799
Hey!

107
00:06:20,969 --> 00:06:23,741
Hey! You have to take the bed back!

108
00:06:23,859 --> 00:06:25,687
You rotten brats!

109
00:06:33,538 --> 00:06:36,090
If she didn't come here,
where could she have gone?

110
00:06:42,985 --> 00:06:44,038
Se Ri?

111
00:06:46,064 --> 00:06:47,677
Joong Bin.

112
00:06:48,457 --> 00:06:50,702
What are you doing here?
This is my son's room.

113
00:06:50,727 --> 00:06:53,037
I know. I was wondering if my daughter...

114
00:06:53,624 --> 00:06:55,406
I mean,

115
00:06:55,432 --> 00:06:57,694
has Ji Ni been here?

116
00:06:57,718 --> 00:06:58,718
Ji Ni?

117
00:07:00,434 --> 00:07:01,858
Employee Na Ji Ni?

118
00:07:02,305 --> 00:07:04,425
Ji Ni's your daughter, Se Ri?

119
00:07:05,089 --> 00:07:06,089
Yes.

120
00:07:08,512 --> 00:07:10,817
This must be a lot to take in.

121
00:07:11,081 --> 00:07:15,990
I didn't know you were Ji Hu's father
until recently either.

122
00:07:16,883 --> 00:07:18,349
I see.

123
00:07:18,658 --> 00:07:20,345
How did it all get so tangled up?

124
00:07:22,345 --> 00:07:25,516
I heard Ji Ni came by earlier.

125
00:07:25,636 --> 00:07:27,136
- But...
- I heard your wife...

126
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:29,175
gave her a hard time.

127
00:07:29,465 --> 00:07:32,903
She was worried about your son.
Aren't you being too harsh on her?

128
00:07:32,928 --> 00:07:35,088
She's the reason he got hurt.

129
00:07:35,493 --> 00:07:37,532
- Joong Bin.
- You should leave.

130
00:07:38,112 --> 00:07:40,301
And keep her away from here too.

131
00:07:42,712 --> 00:07:43,781
Okay.

132
00:07:48,645 --> 00:07:51,957
You said I'd raised my daughter well
after my husband passed away.

133
00:07:51,981 --> 00:07:53,761
You're changing your tune.

134
00:07:54,134 --> 00:07:55,709
Because I'm the mistress.

135
00:07:56,407 --> 00:07:57,583
Fine.

136
00:07:57,679 --> 00:07:58,679
That's what the paperwork says.

137
00:07:58,704 --> 00:08:01,924
- But Ji Ni did nothing wrong.
- Se Ri.

138
00:08:01,942 --> 00:08:04,908
If you're a general,
does that make Ji Hu a general too?

139
00:08:05,045 --> 00:08:06,208
Of course not.

140
00:08:06,592 --> 00:08:08,037
Being an adult means...

141
00:08:08,062 --> 00:08:11,357
being your own person,
separate from your parents.

142
00:08:11,598 --> 00:08:14,924
I've dealt with this kind of prejudice
plenty of times,

143
00:08:15,229 --> 00:08:17,366
but I never expected it from you, too.

144
00:08:18,477 --> 00:08:19,477
Fine.

145
00:08:19,551 --> 00:08:22,984
Please keep Ji Hu away from Ji Ni.

146
00:08:23,009 --> 00:08:25,196
I'll do everything I can.

147
00:08:25,595 --> 00:08:26,595
Goodbye.

148
00:08:50,632 --> 00:08:52,424
What?

149
00:08:58,005 --> 00:08:59,702
I'll do it.

150
00:09:00,385 --> 00:09:02,177
Tie it up tight. Keep it out of sight.

151
00:09:02,365 --> 00:09:03,654
She'll make a scene if she sees it.

152
00:09:05,297 --> 00:09:06,512
Na Ji Ni!

153
00:09:07,565 --> 00:09:08,992
What happened to you?

154
00:09:10,109 --> 00:09:11,153
Mom.

155
00:09:11,491 --> 00:09:12,600
I'm sorry.

156
00:09:12,625 --> 00:09:13,742
You!

157
00:09:13,767 --> 00:09:15,486
The taxi's here. Hurry up!

158
00:09:36,864 --> 00:09:38,113
Na Ji Ni!

159
00:09:39,548 --> 00:09:40,992
Na Ji Ni!

160
00:09:46,278 --> 00:09:48,119
Cha Seung Woo's her brother?

161
00:09:51,132 --> 00:09:53,836
So that's why he kept hanging around me
and asking me all those questions?

162
00:09:54,131 --> 00:09:57,179
Cha Seung Woo, you're in on it too,
aren't you?

163
00:10:08,165 --> 00:10:09,323
Dad.

164
00:10:10,667 --> 00:10:11,696
It's me.

165
00:10:12,567 --> 00:10:13,927
They found out I'm not really sick.

166
00:10:13,929 --> 00:10:16,667
Just like your mom,
you can't do anything right.

167
00:10:17,712 --> 00:10:18,994
Just go in for questioning first.

168
00:10:19,019 --> 00:10:20,209
Dad!

169
00:10:20,867 --> 00:10:22,447
I had no choice!

170
00:10:22,620 --> 00:10:24,462
I don't expect anything from you.
Just keep your head down.

171
00:10:24,632 --> 00:10:25,965
You'll never amount to anything.

172
00:10:25,990 --> 00:10:27,528
How can you say that to me?

173
00:10:28,258 --> 00:10:31,111
They say flowers die
if you insult them every day.

174
00:10:31,711 --> 00:10:33,237
And I'm your own child.

175
00:10:34,498 --> 00:10:36,276
You always insult my mom and me together.

176
00:10:36,707 --> 00:10:38,006
You're really too cruel.

177
00:10:42,118 --> 00:10:43,623
What happened here?

178
00:10:44,552 --> 00:10:46,706
You didn't even notice a patient
being taken away.

179
00:10:46,837 --> 00:10:48,626
What on earth do you do right?

180
00:10:49,997 --> 00:10:51,485
I'm sorry.

181
00:10:52,337 --> 00:10:54,115
Seriously.

182
00:11:02,205 --> 00:11:03,443
Wash up, then drink it.

183
00:11:03,467 --> 00:11:05,312
You do whatever you want
just because mom isn't here.

184
00:11:08,371 --> 00:11:11,492
We've lived together for far too long.

185
00:11:11,782 --> 00:11:13,187
We really need to live apart.

186
00:11:13,555 --> 00:11:14,807
Is she okay?

187
00:11:15,247 --> 00:11:16,247
Yeah.

188
00:11:18,225 --> 00:11:21,227
Seung Hyun, the way you looked at Do Hee
earlier was like you'd seen an alien.

189
00:11:21,372 --> 00:11:22,520
You've never met anyone
like her before, right?

190
00:11:22,632 --> 00:11:24,939
How did you even film
with a psycho like that?

191
00:11:25,035 --> 00:11:26,599
Don't ever see her again.

192
00:11:26,819 --> 00:11:29,207
You'll end up in trouble again.

193
00:11:29,292 --> 00:11:31,267
You have no principles
and no sense of caution.

194
00:11:31,718 --> 00:11:33,064
I have no reason to see her again.

195
00:11:41,804 --> 00:11:44,024
I'm not eating banh xeo. I'm sick of it.

196
00:11:44,226 --> 00:11:45,967
Eat it. It's the last time.

197
00:11:45,992 --> 00:11:47,834
I won't make it for you again,
even if you ask.

198
00:11:48,197 --> 00:11:49,387
What do you mean?

199
00:11:49,578 --> 00:11:53,405
Someone I know said there's an opening
at the district office.

200
00:11:54,684 --> 00:11:57,109
Can I have a drink with you too?

201
00:12:03,364 --> 00:12:05,540
I told her I had a stiff neck.

202
00:12:07,978 --> 00:12:10,378
Thank you for helping me.

203
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:14,015
Why haul the bed up
when you couldn't handle it?

204
00:12:16,887 --> 00:12:19,614
I was only trying to take a picture
to prove she was faking being sick.

205
00:12:19,638 --> 00:12:20,944
You need to be more careful.

206
00:12:22,515 --> 00:12:26,123
Still, I got a picture of Do Do Hee
standing without assistance,

207
00:12:26,147 --> 00:12:28,892
so I'll submit it to the police tomorrow
and ask them to investigate.

208
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,440
You accomplished your goal.

209
00:12:30,465 --> 00:12:31,830
Let's have a toast.

210
00:12:32,077 --> 00:12:35,330
Now Do Hee will go to prison,
and we just need Ji Hu to wake up, right?

211
00:12:36,218 --> 00:12:37,312
Okay.

212
00:12:37,652 --> 00:12:39,652
Here's to a happy ending.

213
00:12:39,729 --> 00:12:40,729
Cheers!

214
00:12:41,078 --> 00:12:42,194
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

215
00:12:45,678 --> 00:12:48,364
- Try some. I've improved the recipe.
- No, thanks.

216
00:12:48,389 --> 00:12:51,212
- I had some today, though.
- It's delicious.

217
00:12:51,774 --> 00:12:53,031
It's takeout.

218
00:12:54,148 --> 00:12:56,022
Enough with that banh xeo already.

219
00:12:58,872 --> 00:13:01,046
So you're finally going to stop
making this, right?

220
00:13:01,071 --> 00:13:03,360
Yeah. I'm never making banh xeo again.

221
00:13:03,973 --> 00:13:06,297
- This stuff doesn't taste good.
- Seriously.

222
00:13:33,678 --> 00:13:34,678
Honey,

223
00:13:36,202 --> 00:13:39,067
do you know how I feel?

224
00:13:40,958 --> 00:13:42,518
Even if I were to die now,

225
00:13:44,571 --> 00:13:47,629
our dear Ji Ni wouldn't be alone anymore.

226
00:13:50,778 --> 00:13:53,454
She swore she'd never get married,

227
00:13:54,427 --> 00:13:56,597
so I worried I'd die and leave her alone.

228
00:14:04,525 --> 00:14:06,159
What are you going to do
when Ji Hu wakes up?

229
00:14:06,915 --> 00:14:08,115
Are you still going to reject him?

230
00:14:08,365 --> 00:14:09,778
That's such an old-fashioned thing to say.

231
00:14:09,780 --> 00:14:10,921
Why would you...

232
00:14:10,922 --> 00:14:13,254
No. I love him too.

233
00:14:13,891 --> 00:14:15,539
I'm not going to hide it anymore.

234
00:14:16,028 --> 00:14:17,670
I'm going to be honest too.

235
00:14:19,785 --> 00:14:21,616
Because I wasn't honest,

236
00:14:22,352 --> 00:14:24,291
Ji Hu ended up like this.

237
00:14:27,705 --> 00:14:29,433
I feel responsible.

238
00:14:35,145 --> 00:14:37,591
It's embarrassing
when you look at me like that.

239
00:14:39,952 --> 00:14:41,233
Is it because she's never dated anyone?

240
00:14:41,545 --> 00:14:42,914
She gets embarrassed over everything.

241
00:14:43,281 --> 00:14:44,550
You made the right choice.

242
00:14:46,198 --> 00:14:47,698
Don't you have anything besides banh xeo?

243
00:14:51,373 --> 00:14:53,151
(Boyak Oriental Medicine Clinic,
Liebe Singing Class)

244
00:14:53,825 --> 00:14:56,109
- No way.
- I know, right?

245
00:14:56,255 --> 00:14:58,617
I couldn't believe it either.
I asked them several times.

246
00:14:59,305 --> 00:15:00,831
Do Do Hee tried to hit you,

247
00:15:00,833 --> 00:15:03,231
but since she didn't actually hit you,
they say there's no case.

248
00:15:04,518 --> 00:15:07,028
So she actually has to commit murder
for it to count?

249
00:15:07,085 --> 00:15:08,978
Are they telling me to die first
before I can press charges?

250
00:15:09,265 --> 00:15:10,265
No.

251
00:15:10,569 --> 00:15:13,484
There's evidence she intended to kill you,
so you can file a complaint,

252
00:15:14,532 --> 00:15:16,223
but the punishment would be pretty light.

253
00:15:16,732 --> 00:15:18,052
She might only get fined.

254
00:15:18,772 --> 00:15:20,796
But what would a fine even mean to her?

255
00:15:22,165 --> 00:15:24,399
Then Ji Hu will have to do it.

256
00:15:24,929 --> 00:15:25,929
Yeah.

257
00:15:27,038 --> 00:15:29,763
Still, she'll face penalties
for the car accident and drunk driving.

258
00:15:29,992 --> 00:15:32,092
I heard you went
to the police station this morning.

259
00:15:32,094 --> 00:15:33,094
Yeah.

260
00:15:33,432 --> 00:15:37,958
I took it in and showed them first thing
this morning. They were surprised.

261
00:15:38,058 --> 00:15:41,265
I guess the police suspected
she was faking being sick too.

262
00:15:42,211 --> 00:15:44,374
I'm going to tell Ji Hu's parents too.

263
00:15:44,662 --> 00:15:46,360
They'll find out eventually.

264
00:15:47,014 --> 00:15:48,112
Don't go.

265
00:15:48,212 --> 00:15:50,112
What if you get into trouble again?

266
00:15:56,498 --> 00:15:57,498
Ms. Do Do Hee?

267
00:16:05,552 --> 00:16:06,921
What took you so long?

268
00:16:08,819 --> 00:16:09,819
Let's go.

269
00:16:21,398 --> 00:16:23,650
You know the victim
has filed a complaint, right?

270
00:16:23,762 --> 00:16:25,146
Ji Hu did?

271
00:16:25,598 --> 00:16:27,709
How could he file a complaint
when he's unconscious?

272
00:16:27,711 --> 00:16:29,180
His family filed it on his behalf.

273
00:16:29,712 --> 00:16:31,512
Ms. Na Ji Ni has already been questioned
as a witness.

274
00:16:31,692 --> 00:16:33,358
In the video,

275
00:16:33,439 --> 00:16:36,869
Ms. Na Ji Ni is clearly visible
ahead of you, yet you didn't slow down.

276
00:16:37,238 --> 00:16:38,702
Why did you keep driving
at the same speed?

277
00:16:39,115 --> 00:16:40,352
Well, Detective...

278
00:16:41,312 --> 00:16:43,936
I'm not a very good driver.

279
00:16:44,472 --> 00:16:46,676
I only recently returned from England.

280
00:16:46,678 --> 00:16:48,012
You can verify that
during your investigation.

281
00:16:49,405 --> 00:16:53,471
I panicked in the moment
and couldn't hit the brakes in time.

282
00:16:54,272 --> 00:16:55,925
I didn't do it on purpose.

283
00:16:56,592 --> 00:16:58,724
I'll pay for the damages. I'm sorry.

284
00:17:00,811 --> 00:17:03,040
I got upset
after fighting with my boyfriend.

285
00:17:03,585 --> 00:17:06,638
I was so distracted
that I wasn't watching the road properly.

286
00:17:07,132 --> 00:17:09,292
I didn't keep my speed up on purpose.

287
00:17:11,412 --> 00:17:12,742
I was wrong.

288
00:17:13,294 --> 00:17:16,411
I had absolutely no intention
of killing her.

289
00:17:17,148 --> 00:17:18,201
I see.

290
00:17:18,872 --> 00:17:23,038
Then do you admit that you were driving
under the influence of alcohol?

291
00:17:24,922 --> 00:17:27,581
Yes. I'll accept the punishment.

292
00:17:32,078 --> 00:17:35,087
What are you two doing here together?

293
00:17:35,368 --> 00:17:37,021
We ran into each other out front.

294
00:17:37,232 --> 00:17:40,065
Sun Kyung, Do Hee is being questioned
by the police today.

295
00:17:40,118 --> 00:17:41,438
Ji Ni made that happen.

296
00:17:41,439 --> 00:17:44,125
- Really?
- Good for her.

297
00:17:49,885 --> 00:17:52,857
Apparently, Do Hee was moving around
even with her arms bandaged.

298
00:17:52,859 --> 00:17:55,218
Ji Ni took pictures
and showed them to the police.

299
00:17:55,292 --> 00:17:57,033
She told them to investigate
because Do Hee was faking it.

300
00:17:59,258 --> 00:18:00,562
At least she has a conscience.

301
00:18:00,792 --> 00:18:02,729
This whole mess happened because of her.

302
00:18:03,618 --> 00:18:05,238
That's not true, Sun Kyung.

303
00:18:05,239 --> 00:18:06,829
Ji Hu just cares about Ji Ni so...

304
00:18:08,934 --> 00:18:10,617
He's just overflowing
with love for humanity.

305
00:18:10,845 --> 00:18:12,761
You're not just massaging him any old way?

306
00:18:12,763 --> 00:18:16,498
I'm massaging specific acupressure points.

307
00:18:16,585 --> 00:18:20,197
This is an expensive massage, you know.
The least you could do is say thank you.

308
00:18:21,172 --> 00:18:22,447
Thank you, Sa Bin.

309
00:18:23,671 --> 00:18:24,671
You're welcome.

310
00:18:30,692 --> 00:18:34,200
Even after all this,
she still hasn't even thanked Ji Ni.

311
00:18:35,664 --> 00:18:37,898
Don't mind Sun Kyung. Just focus on Ji Hu.

312
00:18:38,265 --> 00:18:40,303
I'm trying, but I can't help feeling hurt.

313
00:18:40,305 --> 00:18:41,940
What did she say?

314
00:18:42,452 --> 00:18:43,774
It's about Ji Ni.

315
00:18:43,932 --> 00:18:46,003
She asked how we could accept
the daughter of a mistress.

316
00:18:46,985 --> 00:18:50,777
If she finds out Se Ri knows Joong Bin,
she'll make a scene.

317
00:18:52,398 --> 00:18:53,853
One problem after another.

318
00:18:56,221 --> 00:18:57,551
Exactly.

319
00:18:59,617 --> 00:19:02,502
I ran into Ji Ni at the cafe today.

320
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,225
She said she wanted
to pray in the hospital's prayer room.

321
00:19:06,358 --> 00:19:07,358
She won't visit Ji Hu's room...

322
00:19:07,964 --> 00:19:09,561
to avoid causing you more trouble.

323
00:19:10,235 --> 00:19:11,296
Poor girl.

324
00:19:12,318 --> 00:19:15,835
I hope Ji Hu wakes up soon
and realizes how Ji Ni feels.

325
00:19:16,156 --> 00:19:17,261
Exactly.

326
00:19:17,645 --> 00:19:19,299
She can't even visit his room.

327
00:19:19,826 --> 00:19:22,372
Watching her walk to the prayer room
made my heart ache.

328
00:19:22,712 --> 00:19:24,918
They seemed like such star-crossed lovers.

329
00:19:27,658 --> 00:19:30,250
What are you making for dinner?
I'll help you.

330
00:19:30,399 --> 00:19:33,918
They both barely eat,
so I have no idea what to cook.

331
00:19:35,918 --> 00:19:38,315
I heard you ate with Ji Ni yesterday.

332
00:19:38,443 --> 00:19:40,091
What did you have?

333
00:19:40,961 --> 00:19:43,424
- Just sushi.
- Sushi?

334
00:19:46,245 --> 00:19:48,290
That gives me no new ideas for dinner.

335
00:19:48,605 --> 00:19:51,017
Well, actually, it wasn't like that.

336
00:19:51,121 --> 00:19:53,125
It was my birthday,
so the Maestro treated me...

337
00:19:53,658 --> 00:19:55,071
Please don't misunderstand.

338
00:19:55,072 --> 00:19:56,293
Ji Ni was there too...

339
00:19:56,620 --> 00:20:00,007
I gave Ji Ni acupuncture.
She was hurt in the accident.

340
00:20:00,009 --> 00:20:01,620
So that was the excuse...

341
00:20:02,014 --> 00:20:03,494
Who's accusing you?

342
00:20:03,832 --> 00:20:06,315
You're confessing everything
without anyone even asking.

343
00:20:09,151 --> 00:20:10,210
Birthday?

344
00:20:10,884 --> 00:20:12,546
Your birthday, Sa Bin?

345
00:20:13,588 --> 00:20:14,588
I can't believe it.

346
00:20:14,865 --> 00:20:16,626
I was sure I remembered it.

347
00:20:17,634 --> 00:20:20,252
It's okay. I know you've had
a lot on your mind, Yeong Ju.

348
00:20:20,254 --> 00:20:23,681
But it's your first birthday
since we got married.

349
00:20:23,995 --> 00:20:24,995
My goodness.

350
00:20:25,452 --> 00:20:28,447
I forgot my son's birthday,
and now my husband's too.

351
00:20:29,071 --> 00:20:31,427
Sa Bin, I think I really have dementia.

352
00:20:32,002 --> 00:20:33,086
Don't be ridiculous!

353
00:20:33,405 --> 00:20:34,538
Take that back.

354
00:20:34,898 --> 00:20:36,993
The Maestro took care of everything.

355
00:20:38,232 --> 00:20:41,625
Just because I'm understanding,
you keep bringing up your female friend?

356
00:20:42,878 --> 00:20:46,401
Make me a birthday meal
once Ji Hu wakes up.

357
00:20:47,435 --> 00:20:48,580
Okay.

358
00:20:52,332 --> 00:20:54,490
So you didn't swallow the dashcam card?

359
00:20:54,497 --> 00:20:55,674
Of course not.

360
00:20:56,125 --> 00:20:58,811
Why would I make it look
like I was destroying evidence?

361
00:20:59,991 --> 00:21:02,000
Then how do you explain...

362
00:21:02,002 --> 00:21:05,278
this dashcam card
we recovered from your vomit?

363
00:21:05,572 --> 00:21:06,931
How would I know?

364
00:21:07,292 --> 00:21:08,558
You probably found it in the car.

365
00:21:09,985 --> 00:21:11,135
So you took the card out?

366
00:21:11,137 --> 00:21:12,516
No, I never touched it.

367
00:21:12,518 --> 00:21:14,318
- Listen, Do Do Hee.
- I...

368
00:21:14,418 --> 00:21:16,003
I told you I'd been drinking.

369
00:21:16,524 --> 00:21:17,784
I'm telling the truth.

370
00:21:17,932 --> 00:21:19,698
I don't know anything about the card.

371
00:21:19,852 --> 00:21:21,668
I don't know where you got it,

372
00:21:22,249 --> 00:21:24,046
but don't try to blame me for it.

373
00:21:24,198 --> 00:21:26,848
This is because there are no cameras
in the room, isn't it?

374
00:21:26,850 --> 00:21:27,850
Me?

375
00:21:28,452 --> 00:21:30,105
There are no cameras in the room?

376
00:21:31,626 --> 00:21:32,626
Is that so?

377
00:21:33,898 --> 00:21:35,153
Fine.

378
00:21:39,005 --> 00:21:41,096
So I can go home now, right?

379
00:21:41,098 --> 00:21:43,398
We can't release you.
You're a flight risk.

380
00:21:43,725 --> 00:21:45,073
There are still unverified details...

381
00:21:45,074 --> 00:21:47,002
and questions about the dashcam card.

382
00:21:47,476 --> 00:21:49,358
A complaint has also been filed
on the victim's behalf.

383
00:21:49,465 --> 00:21:51,003
Let's take you to a holding cell first.

384
00:21:51,997 --> 00:21:53,498
- Detective Kang.
- Yes, sir.

385
00:21:53,980 --> 00:21:54,980
What?

386
00:21:56,220 --> 00:21:58,752
What's this? Handcuffs?

387
00:21:59,352 --> 00:22:01,050
Hey, why am I going to a holding cell?

388
00:22:01,925 --> 00:22:02,925
Come with me.

389
00:22:03,475 --> 00:22:04,475
Hey!

390
00:22:06,045 --> 00:22:08,960
You made sure Do Do Hee
can't get out of this, right?

391
00:22:09,205 --> 00:22:11,271
Ambassador Do won't sit back and watch.

392
00:22:11,824 --> 00:22:13,333
She won't just walk free, right?

393
00:22:13,545 --> 00:22:15,898
I've secured the investigation records.
Don't worry.

394
00:22:16,525 --> 00:22:18,572
I'll push for a further investigation.

395
00:22:18,997 --> 00:22:21,834
Even if Ji Hu doesn't wake up,
I'll pursue this on his behalf.

396
00:22:21,836 --> 00:22:22,924
Of course.

397
00:22:23,958 --> 00:22:25,539
We can't back down.

398
00:22:28,518 --> 00:22:30,439
It's already been almost two weeks.

399
00:22:31,702 --> 00:22:34,665
They say if it goes on for a month,
he might never wake up.

400
00:22:34,905 --> 00:22:38,071
Even if he wakes up,
he may not recover fully...

401
00:22:38,072 --> 00:22:39,890
I told you not to imagine the worst.

402
00:22:40,058 --> 00:22:42,605
What can I do?
I can't stop thinking about it.

403
00:22:42,792 --> 00:22:44,232
Go home and get some rest today.

404
00:22:44,485 --> 00:22:45,685
Take some medicine and sleep.

405
00:22:58,958 --> 00:23:00,365
You've been calling a lot.

406
00:23:00,639 --> 00:23:01,795
Drop the complaint.

407
00:23:02,616 --> 00:23:04,398
- I'm hanging up.
- General.

408
00:23:04,615 --> 00:23:06,177
(Investigation into Im Joong Bin's past
and any unusual circumstances)

409
00:23:06,178 --> 00:23:08,614
You said you retired
just before becoming a lieutenant general.

410
00:23:09,269 --> 00:23:11,030
It seems you left suddenly.

411
00:23:12,287 --> 00:23:13,363
Wait a moment.

412
00:23:25,158 --> 00:23:26,696
So you're digging into my past.

413
00:23:27,118 --> 00:23:28,547
I haven't even started.

414
00:23:30,678 --> 00:23:33,190
When I heard my daughter
had been taken to a holding cell,

415
00:23:33,192 --> 00:23:35,666
I suddenly became curious. That's all.

416
00:23:35,925 --> 00:23:37,628
And if I don't drop the complaint?

417
00:23:37,630 --> 00:23:38,903
It'll cause trouble for us both.

418
00:23:39,245 --> 00:23:41,200
Why you retired so suddenly...

419
00:23:41,201 --> 00:23:43,259
and why you live far
from the center of power...

420
00:23:43,547 --> 00:23:46,513
I'll uncover whatever
you've been keeping hidden.

421
00:23:46,765 --> 00:23:49,998
You buried Lieutenant No's desertion case,
and he's still with you.

422
00:23:50,457 --> 00:23:51,612
That was easy to uncover.

423
00:23:51,614 --> 00:23:52,614
Ambassador.

424
00:23:53,380 --> 00:23:54,972
Leave my people out of this.

425
00:23:54,974 --> 00:23:56,860
Then leave my daughter alone too.

426
00:23:57,414 --> 00:23:58,414
Goodbye.

427
00:24:19,512 --> 00:24:20,643
Ji Hu.

428
00:24:21,255 --> 00:24:23,454
What are you thinking about right now?

429
00:24:26,652 --> 00:24:29,024
I can't be by your side,

430
00:24:29,458 --> 00:24:31,059
so all I can do is pray.

431
00:24:35,331 --> 00:24:37,372
Come back to me soon.

432
00:24:39,592 --> 00:24:41,621
I want to talk with you.

433
00:24:46,518 --> 00:24:48,020
I miss you so much.

434
00:24:51,125 --> 00:24:52,125
I...

435
00:24:53,387 --> 00:24:54,927
was abandoned when I was born.

436
00:24:56,378 --> 00:24:58,133
My adoptive parents brought me up.

437
00:25:01,018 --> 00:25:02,731
They're wonderful people.

438
00:25:03,552 --> 00:25:05,480
I live my life trying
to repay their kindness.

439
00:25:17,178 --> 00:25:20,511
I saw myself in you.

440
00:25:21,698 --> 00:25:23,206
I thought we were so much alike.

441
00:25:24,672 --> 00:25:25,988
Having someone just like you...

442
00:25:26,914 --> 00:25:28,463
can be a kind of salvation.

443
00:25:29,972 --> 00:25:33,935
While trying so hard to be loved,
I kept wishing I were dead.

444
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,878
Loving you was the first thing...

445
00:25:37,996 --> 00:25:39,752
that made me feel truly alive.

446
00:25:40,433 --> 00:25:41,511
Strange, isn't it?

447
00:25:42,132 --> 00:25:45,249
Giving love has brought me peace.

448
00:25:49,452 --> 00:25:51,383
I'm at peace even with your rejection.

449
00:25:57,925 --> 00:25:59,720
I won't reject you.

450
00:26:01,945 --> 00:26:03,699
I regret it so much.

451
00:26:08,452 --> 00:26:09,983
I was wrong.

452
00:26:11,887 --> 00:26:13,704
Ji Hu, I'm sorry...

453
00:26:16,611 --> 00:26:18,242
for making you feel lonely.

454
00:26:20,385 --> 00:26:21,849
I'm so sorry.

455
00:26:49,452 --> 00:26:50,560
Ji Hu.

456
00:26:52,060 --> 00:26:53,689
Right now, Ji Ni...

457
00:26:54,754 --> 00:26:56,760
is praying for you.

458
00:26:57,638 --> 00:26:58,661
You know that, right?

459
00:27:00,072 --> 00:27:01,418
Wake up soon.

460
00:27:17,805 --> 00:27:18,894
Ji Hu.

461
00:27:20,199 --> 00:27:21,981
Ji Hu, are you awake?

462
00:27:29,491 --> 00:27:30,800
Where's Do Hee?

463
00:27:32,199 --> 00:27:33,275
Do Hee?

464
00:27:34,238 --> 00:27:36,243
The police are questioning her.

465
00:27:36,727 --> 00:27:40,870
Your dad is taking a firm stand,
so you don't need to worry.

466
00:27:48,678 --> 00:27:50,560
- Ji Hu.
- Ji Hu.

467
00:27:52,235 --> 00:27:53,500
You're finally awake.

468
00:27:54,557 --> 00:27:55,557
Ji Hu.

469
00:27:55,559 --> 00:27:56,995
Please ask Do Hee to come.

470
00:27:58,415 --> 00:27:59,415
Do Hee.

471
00:28:28,770 --> 00:28:31,929
(Family Register)

472
00:28:31,931 --> 00:28:33,965
Memory loss? Does that really happen?

473
00:28:33,966 --> 00:28:35,946
You're saying Do Hee hit me with a car?

474
00:28:35,947 --> 00:28:38,580
- So you don't remember?
- You want a settlement?

475
00:28:38,581 --> 00:28:40,921
No matter how I look at it,
I'd choose Do Hee over Ji Ni.

476
00:28:40,922 --> 00:28:42,438
If you stop seeing Ji Hu,

477
00:28:42,439 --> 00:28:45,370
Do Hee won't do anything else to you.

478
00:28:45,372 --> 00:28:46,658
I'll protect Ji Hu too.

479
00:28:46,659 --> 00:28:49,446
I'll make him remember somehow
and make sure Do Hee is punished.

480
00:28:49,645 --> 00:28:50,751
She must be punished.

481
00:28:51,807 --> 00:28:53,807
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
